inkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯正式发布并开源全新 AI 大模型混元 Hy3 preview</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">深度求索发布DeepSeek-V4预览版：全系支持1M超长上下文并开源</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 在 ChatGPT 中推出 Workspace Agents 智能体支持团队协作</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">豆神教育与微软Azure合作推出AI短剧平台并正式上架Microsoft Marketplace</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/337b46aed0243bfa4e67d8308052f931.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">豆神教育在Microsoft AI Tour年度盛会上正式发布“豆神AI短剧平台”，该平台基于多模态AI架构，深度融合文本理解、图像生成、视频生成及智能配音技术。产品功能覆盖从剧本创作、分镜拆解、角色设定到视频合成与成片输出的全流程，旨在为教育工作者、MCN机构及企业品牌提供高效的内容生产工具。目前，豆神AI短剧平台已正式在Microsoft Marketplace上架，面向全球企业客户提供SaaS服务。此次合作标志着豆神教育将AI技术应用从教育领域向更广泛的商业化内容生产领域延伸，通过降低内容创作门槛，为教育知识传播、情境化教学及商业内容创作提供新的技术路径，进一步推动其AI产品在国际市场的商业化布局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达CEO黄仁勋推动全员使用基于GPT-5.5技术的OpenAI Codex编程工具</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3ab5fee05d3a5c9c09aa9954906e4498.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达CEO黄仁勋近日向全体员工发出号召，正式推动全员使用OpenAI Codex编程工具。该工具基于最新的GPT-5.5技术，目前已向英伟达全公司开放。黄仁勋强调，Codex的应用范围不局限于软件开发团队，涵盖工程、产品、法务、市场营销、财务、销售及人力资源等所有部门的1万名员工均已提前体验并取得显著成果。英伟达将Codex定位为“智能队友”，旨在通过AI辅助提升全员工作效率。为确保员工有效掌握该工具，英伟达已联合AI团队成立Codex实验室，并计划在未来几周内举办一系列线上研讨会，提供系统性的入门培训。此次全员部署旨在通过AI技术赋能，推动英伟达在人工智能时代保持行业领先地位，实现更智能、更高效的业务运作模式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯正式发布并开源全新 AI 大模型混元 Hy3 preview</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f46267045cffbd3e423b03d817f19aee.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">4月23日，腾讯正式发布并开源了混元系列最新大模型——混元 Hy3 preview。该模型是混元重建后训练的首个版本，定位为结合快思考与慢思考的混合专家模型（MoE）。Hy3 preview 总参数量达 2950 亿，激活参数为 210 亿，支持最大 256K 上下文长度，在复杂推理、指令遵循、上下文学习、代码处理及智能体（Agent）能力上均有显著提升。目前，该模型已在腾讯云、元宝、ima、CodeBuddy、WorkBuddy、QQ、QQ 浏览器、腾讯文档及腾讯乐享等平台首发。未来，腾讯计划将 Hy3 preview 逐步接入微信公众号、和平精英、腾讯新闻、腾讯自选股、腾讯客服及微信读书等更多生态产品。此次开源与发布标志着腾讯在 AI 基础设施层面的进一步深化，旨在通过更强的逻辑处理能力提升全线产品的智能化</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">深度求索发布DeepSeek-V4预览版：全系支持1M超长上下文并开源</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1c009b2741f44ffac0104de266124afe.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">深度求索（DeepSeek）正式发布并开源DeepSeek-V4系列模型，全系标配1M超长上下文能力。该系列采用创新的DSA稀疏注意力机制，大幅降低长文本处理的计算与显存成本。模型分为两个版本：DeepSeek-V4-Pro（1.6T参数，激活49B）主打顶级推理性能，在Agentic Coding及STEM任务中表现卓越；DeepSeek-V4-Flash（284B参数，激活13B）则侧重极致性价比与推理效率。针对Agent生态，API新增reasoning_effort参数，支持用户灵活调节思考强度。目前模型已上线Hugging Face与魔搭社区。官方提醒，旧版deepseek-chat与deepseek-reasoner模型将于2026年7月24日停用，建议开发者尽快迁移。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 在 ChatGPT 中推出 Workspace Agents 智能体支持团队协作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e189c960baf28424a890510b7398c525.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 于 4 月 23 日正式发布 Workspace Agents，旨在通过 ChatGPT 平台支持团队创建协作智能体，以处理复杂任务与长周期工作流。该功能由 Codex 提供底层支持，具备文件处理、代码运行、工具调用及记忆存储能力，支持全天候云端运行。Workspace Agents 可集成 Slack 并实现定时调度，通过将隐性知识转化为显性工作流，协助团队完成软件审查、指标报告及自动工单提交等任务。目前，该功能已面向 ChatGPT Business、Enterprise、Edu 及 Teachers 计划用户开放研究预览，在 2026 年 5 月 6 日前可免费使用，后续将转为积分计费模式。OpenAI 内部已部署多种应用实例，验证了其在整合通话记录、自动化财务结账等场景下的效率提升。未来，</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
